# hal-minting-contracts enclave. Exact repo-root-relative paths, one per line (no wildcards, no directory prefixes).
# A change to any path below that merges into master needs operator approval. Why each is here: CANONICAL_CONTRACT.md.
# Scope (operator decision 2, contract-repo clarification): the on-chain Aiken source only. Test-only Aiken files, npm/TS builders, config, build artifacts and workflows follow ordinary agent review.
# Path matching cannot tell a test block from a validator in the same file, so a mixed file stays listed.

